open MvPolynomial ReciprocityTheory.ChartRestriction.G.Geo ReciprocityTheory.ChartRestriction.G.ArakelovGeometry ReciprocityTheory.ChartRestriction.G.AI.I1 ReciprocityTheory.ChartRestriction.G.AI.I4

